{
  "id": 97962700,
  "iid": 2858,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix for possibly uninitialised variable in packet-mac-nr.c",
  "description": "From build under Ubuntu 20.04:\n\n```\n/<<BUILDDIR>>/wireshark-3.5.0+git20210429070141~e8adef52/epan/dissectors/packet-mac-nr.c: In function ‘dissect_mac_nr’:\n/<<BUILDDIR>>/wireshark-3.5.0+git20210429070141~e8adef52/epan/dissectors/packet-mac-nr.c:1900:55: error: ‘scell_bitmap2_3_4’ may be used uninitialized in this function [-Werror=maybe-uninitialized]\n 1900 |                                 if (scell_bitmap2_3_4 & (1 << n)) {\n      |                                     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~\n/<<BUILDDIR>>/wireshark-3.5.0+git20210429070141~e8adef52/epan/dissectors/packet-mac-nr.c:1827:33: note: ‘scell_bitmap2_3_4’ was declared here\n 1827 |                         guint32 scell_bitmap2_3_4;\n      |                                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\ncc1: all warnings being treated as errors\n\n```\n\nscell_bitmap2_3_4 only gets initialised when lcid == MULTIPLE_ENTRY_PHR_4_LCID in line 1835. Setting it to 0 on declaration makes sure it has a defined value.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-04-29T10:33:59.483Z",
